1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:14,500
WanderWise: Bedrock writes the answers, but WHICH tool to call
goes to Strands Decider 2B.

2
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:30,500
No LLM here, just the decision model. Six requests, all routed
correctly. ~94 ms each.

3
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:41,500
"Sleep near Shibuya" has no word like hotel, yet routes to
find_hotels at 0.965. It reads intent.

4
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:59,500
The full agent: Bedrock proposes a tool, Decider 2B checks it.
Agrees on find_hotels (0.96), proceeds.

5
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:11,500
Bedrock writes the hotel options. Router paths are all tested.

6
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:41,000
The LLM picked search_flights for a lodging ask. Decider
redirected to find_hotels at 97%.

7
00:01:49,000 --> 00:02:04,000
Reusable: drop DeciderToolRouter into any Strands agent.
Small model decides, Bedrock talks.
